  "properties": {
    "title": "FOSS4G Europe 2025",
    "description": "Description: Tartu hosts the largest FOSS4G-Europr ever. In 2025 the main FOSS4G is again outside Europe, so let's keep it going.\r\nPerson to contact: Lu\u00eds de Sousa, T\u00f5nis Kardi, Alexander Kmoch, ...\r\n\r\n##Agenda\r\n- Which local chapter can host in 2025\r\n- OSGeo-Europe as a (in)formal chapter\r\n- Financing and relation with OSGeo\r\n\r\n[https://wiki.osgeo.org/wiki/FOSS4G-Europe-2024/BirdsOfAFeather#Room_Destination_Earth_.28Van46_ring.29_on_3.07](https://wiki.osgeo.org/wiki/FOSS4G-Europe-2024/BirdsOfAFeather#Room_Destination_Earth_.28Van46_ring.29_on_3.07)",
